OL,4,CHeritage centre visitors warned of     
OL,5,Cdisruption                             
OL,6,GVisitors to one of Leicestershire's    
OL,7,Gbest-known heritage attractions are    
OL,8,Gbeing warned to expect disruption      
OL,9,Gduring #125,000 improvement work.      
OL,11,FBosworth Battlefield Heritage Centre,  
OL,12,Fwhich marks the site where Richard III 
OL,13,Fwas killed after losing the Battle of  
OL,14,FBosworth to Henry Tudor in 1485, is    
OL,15,Fundergoing a four-week programme of    
OL,16,Fupgrades.                              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
