OL,4,CPolice seize cars in crackdown on      
OL,5,Cpavement parking                       
OL,6,GPolice have seized two vehicles and    
OL,7,Gissued about 30 warning notices during 
OL,8,Ga crackdown on pavement parking.       
OL,10,FOfficers from a neighbourhood policing 
OL,11,Fteam carried out patrols in West       
OL,12,FCotton Close, Cotton End, Northampton, 
OL,13,Fafter residents complained.            
OL,15,FPolice said pedestrians, including     
OL,16,Fwheelchair users and people with       
OL,17,Fpushchairs, had been forced into the   
OL,18,Froad to get past inconsiderately       
OL,19,Fparked cars.                           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
