OL,4,CPlay area's #100,000 refurbishment to  
OL,5,Cstart                                  
OL,6,GA #100,000 improvement scheme for a    
OL,7,Gplay area in Nottinghamshire is due to 
OL,8,Gstart next week.                       
OL,10,FThe refurbishment at The Hook in Lady  
OL,11,FBay, West Bridgford, will see a        
OL,12,Frefreshed playground featuring 14 new  
OL,13,Fpieces of equipment, including a       
OL,14,Fclimbing and play unit with a slide,   
OL,15,Fan accessible roundabout and sensory   
OL,16,Fplay panel.                            
OL,18,FThe works, due to begin on Tuesday,    
OL,19,Fare expected to take a few weeks to    
OL,20,Fcomplete and, weather permitting, the  
OL,21,Fplay park will reopen in time for the  
OL,22,FChristmas holidays.               G4/4 
